323 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 65 0 R
/E (AI initiatives often fail due to execution, not technology. Over-automation without human oversight can introduce blind spots and quality risks. Treating AI as a replacement for professional judgment weakens accountability and client trust. Additionally, weak data governance and security controls expose firms to compliance, confidentiality, and reputational risks. Successful adoption requires clear review checkpoints, defined ownership, and robust data access controls.)
/Pg 18 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
